  "description": "A-LANE FIT – SIMPLE AND RELIABLE FOR THE CITY\n\nThe SPARTA a-LANE FIT is the ideal e-bike for those seeking simplicity and functionality. Equipped with a powerful Bosch Active Line motor, this city bike offers a smooth ride through the city. The sleek design, wide tires, and suspension fork ensure a comfortable and enjoyable riding experience, while the handlebar light and SP-connect mount provide practical support for everyday use.\n\nWith the integrated SP-connect smartphone holder, you'll always have your phone within reach and can easily operate the eBike Flow app. This stylish city bike is the perfect fit for an active and modern lifestyle. The a-LANE FIT is a reliable companion for any city ride, combining convenience and quality without any fuss.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands.\nPlease note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
